$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Yan, Bingli; Spilling, Christopher D.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2008), 73(14), 5385-5396

