$DATUM (S)-1-((2R,5R)-5-((R)-1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilyloxy)-2-(4-methoxybenzyloxy)ethyl)tetrahydrofu
ran-2-yl)-4-methyl-5-(phenylthio)pentan-2-one (5): To a flask containing
palladium chloride (11.8 mg, 66.5 μmol) in DMF-H2O (v/v, 3.0 mL/3.0 mL)
at rt was added anhydrous cuprous chloride (75.0 mg, 756 μmol). The
immediately formed black mixture gradually turned green under oxygen
(balloon, 1 atm) over 2 h. A solution of 17 (253.5 mg, 455.2 μmol) in DMF
(1.0 mL) was added via cannula (3 x 1.0 mL washes) at rt and more H2O
(1.0 mL) was added. Then reaction mixture was stirred at 65 °C under an
oxygen atmosphere for 8 h. After cooling to rt, the mixture was diluted
with diethyl ether (20 mL) and water (6 mL). The separated aqueous phase
was extracted with diethyl ether (3 x 20 mL) and the combined organic
phase was dried over anhydrous Na2SO4, filtered and concentrated in
vacuo. The residue was further purified by silica gel flash column
chromatography (hexanes-ethyl acetate, 8:1 to 5:1, v/v) to afford
recovered alkene 17 (123.6 mg, 222.0 μmol) and desired ketone 5. Pale
yellow oil, yield 105.5 mg, 184.2 μmol, 40%, 79% brsm. Rf 0.21
(hexanes-ethyl acetate, 8:1, v/v); [α]D25 -22.0 (c 1.33, CH2Cl2); FTIR
(thin film, KBr) 3059, 2955, 2928, 2901, 2884, 2857, 1713, 1614, 1585,
1514, 1470, 1462, 1360, 1302, 1173, 1090, 1036, 1007, 962, 835, 777, 741
cm-1; 1H NMR (CDCl3, 500 MHz) δ 7.34 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H), 7.29-7.22 (m,
4H), 7.16 (dd, J = 7.5, 7.2 Hz, 1H), 6.86 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 4.43
(center of AB quartet, Δν = 12.3 Hz, JAB = 11.6 Hz, 2H), 4.29 (m, 1H),
4.06 (dt, J = 7.4, 4.0 Hz, 1H), 3.80 (s, 3H), 3.70 (dt, J = 5.4, 4.3 Hz,
1H), 3.52 (dd, J = 9.6, 5.2 Hz, 1H), 3.42 (dd, J = 9.6, 5.8 Hz, 1H), 2.91
(dd, J = 13.0, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 2.82 (dd, J = 13.0, 6.7 Hz, 1H), 2.71 (dd, J
= 16.9, 5.6 Hz, 1H), 2.63 (dd, J = 15.3, 7.1 Hz, 1H), 2.44 (dd, J = 15.3,
5.7 Hz, 1H), 2.40 (dd, J = 16.9, 6.5 Hz, 1H), 2.32 (m, 1H), 2.09 (m, 1H),
1.90 (m, 1H), 1.80 (ddd, J = 17.6, 12.2, 8.0 Hz, 1H), 1.45 (ddd, J =
19.2, 11.9, 8.8 Hz, 1H), 1.03 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 3H), 0.88 (s, 9H), 0.05 (s,
6H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 125 MHz) δ 208.4, 159.0, 136.8, 130.5, 129.2, 129.1,
128.9, 125.8, 113.7, 79.6, 75.6, 74.1, 73.1, 72.3, 55.2, 49.4, 49.1,
40.5, 32.5, 28.8, 27.3, 25.9, 19.6, 18.2, -4.4, -4.8; HRMS (ESI) m/z
calcd for C32H48NaO5SSi+ [M+Na]+ 595.2884, found 595.2888.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, recovered reactant, Raghavan's Wacker oxidation, 13%
overall yield from reg.#190430525 (12 steps)
