$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General Procedure for the Wacker-Type Oxidation A two-necked flask
equipped with a magnetic stirring bar and an argon outlet is charged with
Pd(OAc)2 (13.7 mg, 0.061 mmol), benzoquinone (60 mg, 0.55 mmol) and CH3CN
(7 mL). Water (7mL, CH3CN/H2O=7/1) and then HClO4 (0.13 mL, 0.3 M) are
successively added. The solution is vigorously stirred for 1 h at 20°C
and then the steroid (0.2 g, 0.61 mmol) is added. When the reaction is
over (TLC), the mixture is poured into a 30% aqueous solution of NaOH.
The extracts are filtered and then concentrated under vacuum. The crude
product is purified by chromatography on silica gel (Et2O-petroleum
ether). (±)-(8β ,9β ,14α )-N-Benzyl-2-methoxy-17α
-acetyl-11-azagona-1,3,5(10)-trien-13β -ol (15): (74% yield, 60%
conversion). IR (neat) 3448, 2929, 1607, 1265, 1041, 734 cm-1 ; 1H NMR
(CDCl3) 7.30 (5H, m), 7.08 (1H, d, J = 2.3 Hz), 6.98 (1H, d, J = 8.1Hz),
6.69 (1H, dd, J = 8.1, 2.3 Hz), 4.38 (1H, 1/2AB, J = 13.7 Hz), 4.26 (1H,
1/2AB, J = 13.7 Hz), 4.01 (1H, d, J = 5.1 Hz), 3.78 (3H, s), 3.02 (1H,
m), 2.78 (1H, 1/2AB, J = 1 1.6 Hz), 2.65 (1H, 1/2AB, J = 11.6 Hz), 2.50
(2H, m), 2.30 (1H, m), 2.02 (3H, s), 1.95 (2H, m), 1.70 (5H, m); 13C NMR
(CDCl3) 209.6, 157.7, 141.0, 138.0, 130.7, 129.9, 128.7, 128.5, 127.5,
113.3, 111.2, 80.1, 61.9, 60.4, 59.7, 55.3, 53.3, 43.5, 34.6, 32.1, 25.9,
25.5, 24.7, 23.1. HRMS ca1cd for C26H31NO3 405.2304, Found 405.2308.
