$DATUM 7-(Methoxymethoxy)-2,2-dimethyl-5-(2-oxopropyl)-4H-benzo-[d][1,3]dioxin-4-one
(4). To a solution of 5 (300 mg, 1.08 mmol, 1.00 equiv) in DMF/H2O (10.8
mL, 7:1) were added PdCl2 (48.0 mg, 0.27 mmol, 0.50 equiv) and CuCl (160
mg, 1.62 mmol, 2.00 equiv). The reaction mixture was allowed to stir
under O2 (1 atm) at rt for 48 h. The reaction was then diluted with EtOAc
(10.0 mL) and water (20.0 mL). The aqueous layer was extracted with EtOAc
(3 x 15.0 mL), and the organic extracts were dried over MgSO4, filtered,
and concentrated in vacuo. Flash chromatography (silica, 10% ethyl
acetate in hexanes) afforded 4 as a pale yellow solid (230 mg, 72%
yield).
7-(Methoxymethoxy)-2,2-dimethyl-5-(2-oxopropyl)-4H-benzo-[d][1,3]dioxin-4-one
(4), yield (230 mg, 72%). Rf at 10% ethyl acetate in hexanes 0.30; 1H NMR
(360 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.51 (s, 1H), 6.47 (s, 1H), 5.15 (s, 2H), 4.09 (s,
2H), 3.44 (s, 3H), 2.27 (s, 3H), 1.67 (s, 6H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ
204.8, 201.4, 162.5, 160.6, 158.6, 140.6, 115.1, 105.4, 102.6, 94.1,
56.3, 49.2, 30.0, 25.5 IR (CH2Cl2) 727, 913, 1010, 1081, 1153, 1209,
1286, 1353, 1442, 1581, 1611, 1723, 2252, 2826, 2941, 2997 cm-1. HRMS
(EI) calcd for C15H18O6 (M+) 294.1103, found 294.1117.
