$DATUM regioselective, Wacker oxidation, aerobic
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Catalyst-Controlled Wacker-Type Oxidation: Facile Access to
Functionalized Aldehydes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
